<title>USA: Summit County, Ohio, repriced, top yield raised.</title>
<headline>Summit County, Ohio, repriced, top yield raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons, Inc. said Thursday it repriced Summit County, Ohio's $3.4 million bond deal, raising the top yield five basis points to 5.70 percent from 5.65 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>COUNTY OF SUMMIT, OHIO</p>
<p>RE: $3,390,000</p>
<p>VARIOUS PURPOSE BONDS, SERIES 1997 A</p>
<p>(GENERAL OBLIGATION - LIMITED TAX)</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT IS CLOSED.</p>
<p>WRITTEN AWARD.</p>
<p>MOODY'S: A2		    S&amp;P: A+</p>
<p>DATED: 06/01/1997	    FIRST COUPON: 12/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 12/01</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT     COUPON</p>
<p>12/01/1998		  100M    4.00  %</p>
<p>12/01/1999		  105M    4.40  %</p>
<p>12/01/2000		  110M    4.55  %</p>
<p>12/01/2001		  120M    4.65  %</p>
<p>12/01/2002		  125M    4.75  %</p>
<p>12/01/2003		  130M    4.85  %</p>
<p>12/01/2004		  135M    4.95  %</p>
<p>12/01/2005		  140M    5.00  %</p>
<p>12/01/2006		  145M    5.05  %</p>
<p>12/01/2007		  155M    5.10  %</p>
<p>12/01/2017		2,125M    5.70  %</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 12/01/2007    102.00</p>
<p>		   DTP 12/01/2009</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Thursday, May 22, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is firm for June 4, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry.  DTC is pending.</p>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons, Inc.</p>
<p>S.B.K- Brooks Investment Corp.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
